ttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghostwright/shadow/5eef3683b0654e1a1123fe63efa015e257efcdb5/Shadow/Shadow/Intelligence/Grounding/TrainingDataGenerator.swift"},{"method":"editorial_primary_review","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:16Z","role":"primary","sha256":"8c578527d5aac83a4efb4f3a19969bae14853e0f5b0646ae59afff3dc90d36fa","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghostwright/shadow/5eef3683b0654e1a1123fe63efa015e257efcdb5/LICENSE"},{"method":"license_header","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:40Z","role":"primary","sha256":"8c578527d5aac83a4efb4f3a19969bae14853e0f5b0646ae59afff3dc90d36fa","supports":["licenses.code"],"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghostwright/shadow/HEAD/LICENSE"}],"id":"github:ghostwright/shadow","identifiers":{},"kind":"tool","last_verified_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:38Z","licenses":{"code":{"basis":"repository LICENSE header","declared":"MIT","retrieved_at":"2026-10-20T08:22:40Z","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghostwright/shadow/HEAD/LICENSE"},"data":null,"document":null,"weights":null},"links":[{"rel":"primary","url":"https://github.com/ghostwright/shadow"}],"name":"Shadow","notes":"Requires Apple Silicon, macOS 14 or later and a source build (Swift 6, Rust, XcodeGen). GroundingOracle.swift resolves targets for the Mimicry replay system in four steps: exact accessibility-tree match, fuzzy accessibility match, a local ShowUI-2B model on MLX over a live screenshot, then a vision-model escalation. TrainingDataGenerator.swift turns recorded (screenshot, accessibility state, click) tuples into JSONL grounding examples, and LoRATrainer.swift fine-tunes ShowUI-2B on them through the mlx-vlm Python package once enough new tuples accumulate. The README describes the capture of fourteen signal types, on-device Qwen and Whisper models, a 26-tool agent runtime, and points to a separate computer-use engine from the same publisher for full computer use. Cloud model features are optional with the user's own API key.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ghostwright/shadow/5eef3683b0654e1a1123fe63efa015e257efcdb5/Shadow/Shadow/Intelligence/Grounding/GroundingOracle.swift","target_id":"github:showlab/showui","type":"uses"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"macOS app that records screen, audio, input events and accessibility trees on-device, builds searchable episodes, and replays learned procedures through AX-first grounding with a LoRA-tuned ShowUI-2B fallback.","topics":["recording","data-generation","grounding","memory","screen-understanding"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://github.com/ghostwright/shadow"}
